/CHARACTER. A  5 X 7  POINT MATRIX IS USED.
/SO THREE DISPLAY WORDS BELONG TO EACH CHARACTER
/REFERENCE: MAX-PLANCK-INSTITUT FUER PHYSIK
/UND ASTROPHYSIK, A.J. FLAVELL
/D-8000 MEUNCHEN, WESTERN GERMANY
TABLE,
